10. [2(disz)-kam ur5]-am3# um-ak-e
>>A 79
#tr.en: Having done so a second time,
11. [3(disz)-kam ur5-am3] um-ak-e
>>A 80
#tr.en: having done so a third time, (Martu says):
12. [kug-zu me-da tum3] za#-zu me-da tum3
>>A 81
