13. [{d}mar-tu-me]-en# dumu-zu ga-ba#-ab#-tuku
>>A 82
#tr.en: I, Martu, would rather marry your daughter,
14. [... dumu-zu] ga#-ba-ab#-[tuku]
>>A 83
#tr.en: I would rather marry your daughter [Adgar-kidug]."
