>>A 119
#tr.en: [The men and women] of Inab
10. [...] x x x [kug]-sig17#-ka# mi2 im-ma#-ni#-in#-dug4
>>A 120
#tr.en: he gratified with golden ...
11. [ARAD2-ARAD2] x i3-na-ab#[{ki}]-ke4#-ne#
>>A 121
#tr.en: [The slaves] of Inab
